{"id":"W182d7e32210814856798f83d","zh":"特征频率","en":"","name":"特征频率","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","concept_id":"C213494396007ff4d4abf","families":[],"definition_zh":"反映结构振动模态或主要动力特征的频率。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于识别与显著车体激振相关的不平顺频率，或表征结构固有振动并评价离散误差。前一用途主要分析空间频率，后一用途关注结构模态频率，两者所指的动力特征不同。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W182d7e32210814856798f83d","text":"特征频率","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3db21d2585cc2ad0b2be","source_id":"P121","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文提出基于连续小波变换系数的轨道不平顺时频分析方法,考虑轨道动态几何形变中固定波形的影响,提取轨道不平顺的时频特性,能更为精细地提取轨道不平顺特征时频信号; 同时将对应区段车体振动加速度序列的小波变换时频分析结果与轨道不平顺信号进行比较分析,运用相关性分析方法提取对车体影响较大的特征频率及轨道不平顺类型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sf94d62f4cea636fbfaed","source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"结论 (1) 利用连续小波分析方法,不仅能表征轨道不平顺中存在的特征频率,而且能对特征频率在时域空间的分布进行定位,有利于工务部门掌握线路轨道不平顺的时频域分布信息,制定有效的养护维修策略。","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P099":{"id":"P099","title":"On use of the hierarchical function to achieve efficient and accurate dynamic analysis of vehicle-slab track coupled systems","authors":"L Pan, L Xu, B Yan","year":"2026","doi":"10.1007/s40534-025-00392-6","journal_citation":"Railway Engineering Science, 1-20","label":"Pan等（2026）","overview_slug":"2026-on-use-of-the-hierarchical-function-to-achieve-efficient-and-accurate-dynamic-analysis-of-vehicle-sl"},"P121":{"id":"P121","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","authors":"宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.03.006","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"宁迎智等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"与显著车体激振相对应的频率，文中主要按空间频率分析。","language":"zh","source_id":"P121","paper_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"表征结构固有振动特征，并用于评价离散误差的频率。","language":"zh","source_id":"P099","paper_slug":"2026-on-use-of-the-hierarchical-function-to-achieve-efficient-and-accurate-dynamic-analysis-of-vehicle-sl","title":"利用层次函数实现车辆—板式轨道耦合系统的高效精确动力分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W1740655b78b19e0a5fc02e2c","name":"characteristic frequencies","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W075d3aec0640c37e12445099","name":"Characteristic frequency","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W1740655b78b19e0a5fc02e2c","name":"characteristic frequencies","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W075d3aec0640c37e12445099","name":"Characteristic frequency","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W1740655b78b19e0a5fc02e2c","name":"characteristic frequencies","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W075d3aec0640c37e12445099","name":"Characteristic frequency","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P121","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","authors":"宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.03.006","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"宁迎智等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform"},{"id":"P099","title":"On use of the hierarchical function to achieve efficient and accurate dynamic analysis of vehicle-slab track coupled systems","authors":"L Pan, L Xu, B Yan","year":"2026","doi":"10.1007/s40534-025-00392-6","journal_citation":"Railway Engineering Science, 1-20"